{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The Endless Village</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Endless Village is a cozy idle adventure where you build a bustling, living city under the starry night sky<strong>.</strong> Start small, click to generate resources, and invest in powerful upgrades to unlock passive wealth. Watch your vibrant economy expand the sleepy town into a lively metropolis, filled with unique citizens who populate your world. Dive into satisfying minigames for an extra boost, and chase the ultimate goal: creating the most wealthy and beautiful city on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Incremental Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082740/extras/9415581c126952ab4f0c4fbb4d3dbc17.poster.avif?t=1761224080\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082740/extras/9415581c126952ab4f0c4fbb4d3dbc17.webm?t=1761224080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082740/extras/9415581c126952ab4f0c4fbb4d3dbc17.mp4?t=1761224080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your city</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082740/extras/0630fecbd2fda3f837cdf77015e9302f.poster.avif?t=1761224080\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082740/extras/0630fecbd2fda3f837cdf77015e9302f.webm?t=1761224080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082740/extras/0630fecbd2f